            {
              "content": "=You are a job filtering AI for a product manager with 3-4 years of experience. Analyze this job posting with my actual profile to determine if it's a good fit.\n\nMY ACTUAL PROFILE:\nResume: {{ $('Get Resume').item.json.content }}\nLinkedIn Profile:{{ $('Get Profile').item.json.content }}\n\nSTRICT FILTERING RULES:\nACCEPT IF THESE CONDITIONS ARE MET:\n- Experience: 0-4 years (not 5+ years), 3 years of experience in product management \n- Job Title: Product Manager, Associate, Junior, Entry-level, New Grad, APM, Graduate\n- Employment: Full-time positions only\n- No Senior Language: Zero mentions of \"senior,\" \"lead,\" \"principal,\" \"director,\" \"manager II+,\" \"staff\"\n- Requirements: No \"5+ years,\"\n\nREJECT IF ANY CONDITION IS FOUND:\n- Experience Requirements: 4+ years and above, \"several years,\" \"extensive\"\n- Senior Titles: Senior PM, Lead PM, Principal PM, Director, VP, Head of Product\n- Employment Types: Contract, Consultant, Freelance, Part-time, Internship\n- Industry Experience: \"10+ years in [industry]\"\n\nJOB DATA:\nTitle: {{ $json.title }}\nSeniority: {{ $json.seniorityLevel }}\nEmployment: {{ $json.employmentType }}\nDescription: {{ $json.descriptionText }}\nCompany: {{ $json.companyName }}\n\nANALYSIS PROCESS:\n1. Check the title for entry-level indicators vs senior keywords\n2. Scan description for experience requirements (numbers + \"years\")\n3. Verify employment type is full-time\n\nIMPORTANT CLARIFICATION ON EXPERIENCE LOGIC:\n- If job requires \"3 years experience\" → ACCEPT (3 is less than 4, so it's eligible)\n- If job requires \"2+ years experience\" → ACCEPT (2+ is within 0-4 range)\n- If job requires \"1-3 years experience\" → ACCEPT (within range)\n- If job requires \"5+ years experience\" → REJECT (5+ exceeds 4 years maximum)\n\nThe candidate HAS 3-4 years of experience, so they are QUALIFIED for jobs requiring up to 4 years.\n\nLOGIC CHECK: If the job says \"minimum 3 years required\" and the candidate has 3-4 years, that's a MATCH, not a rejection.\n\nReturn this in JSON format:\n{\n  \"keep_job\": \"true or false\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
