            {
              "content": "=Generate customized resume content sections based on improvement analysis. Use impact-driven bullet point structure: [Impact/Result] + [Action] + [How you did it]. CRITICAL: Stay 100% truthful to actual work performed.\n\nMY ORIGINAL RESUME:{{ $('Get Resume').item.json.content }}\nMY PROFILE:{{ $('Get Profile').item.json.content }}\n\nPlease review both and\n\nTARGET JOB:\nJob Title: {{ $('LinkedIn Scrapper').item.json.title }}\nCompany: {{ $('LinkedIn Scrapper').item.json.companyName }}\nJob Description: {{ $('LinkedIn Scrapper').item.json.descriptionText }}\n\nIMPROVEMENT GUIDANCE:\nATS Keywords: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.ats_optimization.missing_keywords }}\nKeyword Strategy: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.ats_optimization.keyword_integration_strategy }}\nPure Yields Positioning: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.experience_reframing.pure_yields_positioning }}\nZomato Positioning: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.experience_reframing.zomato_positioning }}\nInfosys Angle: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.experience_reframing.infosys_technical_angle }}\nSummary Hook: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.summary_strategy.opening_hook }}\nValue Proposition: {{ $('Optimization Analysis').item.json.message.content.summary_strategy.value_proposition }}\n\n\nBULLET POINT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Use strong action verbs: Led, Drove, Transformed, Pioneered,etc\n- Structure: [Quantified Impact] + [Strategic Action] + [Methodology/Tools]\n- Include metrics and percentages where possible\n- Align language with job description terminology\n- Position Pure Yields experience as product management expertise\n- Make each bullet tell a story of strategic impact\n\nTRUTHFULNESS RULES:\n1. Only describe work actually performed\n2. Use accurate action verbs (analyzed, designed, projected vs. implemented, pioneered, launched)\n3. Clearly distinguish between projections/estimates vs. actual results\n4. Never imply responsibility for work not done\n5. Maintain original achievement levels and scope\n\nPlease review all these details and generate only the tailored content in JSON format:\n{\n  \"professional_summary\": \"2-3 sentence compelling summary tailored for this specific job\",\n  \"enhanced_skills\": {\n    \"product_skills\": \"Enhanced product skills section with job-specific keywords naturally integrated\",\n    \"technical_skills\": \"Enhanced technical skills emphasizing relevant tools and capabilities\",\n    \"functional_skills\": \"Enhanced functional skills highlighting leadership and collaboration\"\n  },\n  \"improved_experience_bullets\": {\n    \"zomato_bullets\": [\n      \"Impact-driven bullet 1 using [Result] + [Action] + [Method] structure\",\n      \"Impact-driven bullet 2 with quantified achievements\", \n      \"Impact-driven bullet 3 aligning with job language\",\n      \"Impact-driven bullet 4 emphasizing relevant PM skills\"\n    ],\n    \"infosys_bullets\": [\n      \"Reframed bullet 1 emphasizing PM-relevant technical skills\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 2 highlighting cross-functional collaboration\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 3 showcasing stakeholder management\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 4 demonstrating data-driven decision making\"\n    ],\n    \"pure_yields_bullets\": [\n      \"Reframed bullet 1 positioning founder experience as PM expertise\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 2 emphasizing product strategy and user research\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 3 highlighting growth metrics and data analysis\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 4 showcasing market analysis and product-market fit\",\n      \"Reframed bullet 5 demonstrating multi-channel product strategy\"\n    ]\n  }\n}\n"
